    "body": "```suggestion\r\n\r\nNot every style string will be displayed correctly by every terminal, in particular the following quirks exist:\r\n- Many terminals disable support for `blink` by default\r\n- `hidden` is not [supported by iTerm](https://gitlab.com/gnachman/iterm2/-/issues/4564).\r\n- `strikethrough` is not supported by the default macOS Terminal.app\r\n```",
